WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — الانتقام من خطيبي الخائن — Episode 15 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-25 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.370
James, I hope you don't mind but I had to borrow Lila for a moment.

2
00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:07.370
What do you mean you borrowed her? She's a human adult with the mind of her own!

3
00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.370
Except you did take her during working hours though.

4
00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:12.370
She didn't even want to see it with me until I mentioned your name.

5
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:17.370
And only then she agreed to please give all your work as free meal and a lunch break.

6
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:21.370
That was the only condition she felt comfortable with sitting with me here.

7
00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:26.370
Lila, must be a good luck charm or something. Thank you, Alex.

8
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.370
Not a big deal. It's just something mysterious about Lila.

9
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.370
You know, I can't really figure it out.

10
00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:40.370
Yeah, I mean, Lila, she's been through a lot and she's a private person.

11
00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:43.370
Be careful not to pry too much.

12
00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.370
Why not? I find mystery intriguing.

13
00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:53.370
Because my friend, some mysteries are better left unsolved and you never know what you might uncover.

14
00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:59.370
Well, what is she? A secret droglord? An assassin killer? Spy?

15
00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:06.370
I highly doubt that. But seriously, she's a private person and she's been through a lot.

16
00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.370
But I already told her I like her.

17
00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:10.370
What'd she say?

18
00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.370
She didn't really reply to me.

19
00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:17.370
I'll just take it slow, Alex. Barely know anything about her.

20
00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:25.190
Yeah, you know, as the time goes by, I eventually will one time.

21
00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:28.190
Yeah, we'll just have to see you, won't we?

22
00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:34.190
I have to apologize in advance, James. I might be stealing your good luck charm from you.
